# UI & Typography Guardrails

## Anti-Slop Visual Rules
- DO NOT use generic AI aesthetic: purple/cyan blur gradients, unnecessary backdrop-blur, gigantic border-radii (`rounded-3xl` on small cards), or floating glowing cards.
- Use solid semantic borders (e.g., `border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800`), purposeful shadows, and ample negative space.

## Typography System
- Maximum 2 font families across the app.
- Hierarchy: Differentiate heading levels strictly via scale (`text-3xl`, `text-xl`) and weight, not just arbitrary colors.
- Readability: Set body text to `leading-relaxed` or `leading-normal` with max width `max-w-prose` (65-75ch) for long reading blocks.
